The '''Suntail Pass''' is a trail located in northeastern [[Mulgore]] that serves as a pilgrimage site for spirit walkers and provides a safer route to the [[Barrens]] for young [[tauren]].<ref>[https://x.com/turtlecraft/status/1815143007404060754 Turtle WoW Team on Twitter] (2024-07-21) (dead link)</ref><ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

